Notebook[{Cell[
"\<Numerical examples from Excel \[LongDash] analytical condition checks\>",
"Title",ExpressionUUID -> "69f92ccd-6169-4de7-96e2-f34dded42549"],Cell[
"\<Representative exact-class parameter sets extracted from the manuscript v3 Excel datasets. The notebook computes derived Michaelis constants, detached-branch inequalities, and the Class 6\[Dash]8 crossing-slope check. These examples illustrate the derivations; they do not re-label the full dataset.\>",
"Text",ExpressionUUID -> "bc63438d-01e0-4d23-ba69-dcb9a52f2295"],Cell[
"\<1. Source and selection of examples\>",
"Section",ExpressionUUID -> "c1fd3bef-b38d-4bba-b498-7a8f3f860fc4"],Cell[
"\<Examples are taken from the manuscript v3 exact-class Excel datasets, sheet ML_Ready_Data. One representative row per exact class is selected near the class median of k2; Classes 7 and 8 come from iteration 4 so their asymmetric first-site parameters are represented.\>",
"Text",ExpressionUUID -> "0201e182-1ae1-4de1-8497-1c01824e6964"],Cell[
